ID: B3-Ch05b-Brother
TEXT:

 "I swear we were going to tell you about the fact that we killed the king's brother!"

 "I am sure you were," the king of the underground says evenly. "Regardless, the facts are before us. Do you have anything of substance to add?"

 "Listen," Daren says, leaning forward with his hands open. "I know how this looks, but we can fix it."

 "People are dying up there right now, healer," the king says, his voice dropping into a grave, flat register. "The royal guards are tearing through the districts, kicking down doors and executing anyone who hesitates. We evacuated the rebel families from the surface, but there is neither the space nor the air beneath the bedrock to shelter the entire population. Innocent civilians are being slaughtered in their homes because the palace is hunting you. Those people would be alive if you had never entered this city. Their blood is on your hands."

